{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/849090-world-of-darkness-and-inverting-traditional-perceptions-on-protaganists","id":849090,"title":"World of Darkness and inverting \"Traditional\" Perceptions on Protaganists.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-17T19:45:14-07:00","id":849090,"title":"World of Darkness and inverting \"Traditional\" Perceptions on Protaganists.","content":"its obvious that one of the core things of World of darkness or Chronicles of Darkness is playing as a &quot;Monster&quot; but it goes deeper then that<br /> <br /> Think of a childling going into their Chrystalis and then acting strangely, or disappearing<br /> <br /> His parents reacting to all that, is generally only considered as a potential impendiment to the kithain<br /> <br /> think a Teenager goes through the first change as a garou gets rounded up by his tribe and then disappears.<br /> <br /> again his parents concerns only exist to add, complications for the garou<br /> <br /> Any more examples of Blatant cases of The traditional protaganist being villified?<br /> <br /> <br /> Chronicles of Darkness turned it up to 180 recently with Beast and &quot;Heroes&quot; <br /> <br /> but theirs also true Faith a trait usualy wielded by antaganists...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 03-17-2016, 10:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T00:29:56-07:00","id":849171,"title":"","content":"Vampire Hunters (both mundane and Imbued) have this in spades. Practically represent it, in fact. First, you get done playing Vampire characters, who are played sympathetically. But when you play a hunter, you must quickly come to realize that the romantic, stylish, badass vampires...are still parasites, that sustain their blasphemous existence by assaulting, violating, or deceiving innocent people. And these hunters, which were previously relentless threats and prime reasons for the primacy of the Masquerade, are now perpetual underdogs facing overwhelming odds, against foes who are all stronger, faster, hardier, more powerful, and more connected than these simple humans could ever be. Humans who only want to stop the wolves that prey always on the human race.<br /> <br /> It's hard not to realize that, no matter how Gothic and romantic they may be - no matter how tortured they come off as - vampires are the villains.<br /> <br /> Looking at it from the other side, meanwhile, you have the hunters themselves. What do you call informal cells of people, arming themselves with possibly illicit firepower, who wage their own private guerrilla war unilaterally, without state or public sanction, oversight, or control? &quot;Extremist Militias&quot; or &quot;Terrorists&quot;. Now remember that these people believe they fight blood-sucking immortals with magic powers, who secretly control all levels of local, state, and possibly national government. Add &quot;Conspiracy Theorists&quot; to the mix. The Imbued, capital &quot;H&quot; Hunters even claim to hear voices from higher powers, telling them who to kill. Anyone on the outside would use words like &quot;Delusional Schizophrenia&quot; or &quot;Cult&quot;.<br /> <br /> It matters little that the hunters are correct. That there are monsters preying on humans who need to be stopped, and no one but the hunters can enact the purges, with what little resources they have available. It certainly doesn't look that way to the police officer or FBI agent or school board member, who sees these people running around with baseball bats, shotguns, and molotov cocktails.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T05:04:38-07:00","id":849199,"title":"","content":"Speaking of the imbued, Asked this before, never got an answer, It seems to me that it would be hard to preserve the &quot;Flavor&quot; of a Hunter the reckoning game, for a anniversary edition, as it seems almost inevitable, they'd become more and more a militia, less and less a &quot;Grab a random weapon and begin picking off monsters&quot; thing. thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T09:13:51-07:00","id":849305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/849090-world-of-darkness-and-inverting-traditional-perceptions-on-protaganists?p=849199#post849199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of the imbued, Asked this before, never got an answer, It seems to me that it would be hard to preserve the &quot;Flavor&quot; of a Hunter the reckoning game, for a anniversary edition, as it seems almost inevitable, they'd become more and more a militia, less and less a &quot;Grab a random weapon and begin picking off monsters&quot; thing. thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohhh i was having this discussion with a friend some time ago.<br /> Whats the first thing that happends when a hunter Fights the supernatural? he goes for a random object, he has no idea what is he doing. The hunter (directly or indirectly) becomes a victim of the circumstances.<br /> i will put the entire Hunter experience with ONE character as an example, No..Two characters.<br /> <br /> Sarah Connor and Ellen Ripley.<br /> <br /> The Terminator: The is a victim who uses her wits to overcome the odds, she has no idea how to fight this machine. She doesnt pull any punches against the T800. Its more, if you see the movie, she does NOTHING to attempt to harm the Terminator, the only one who does are : The Cops, The Punks and Kyle Reese - And we know how that ended up-. The ONLY THING Sarah Connor did, was push a button.<br /> <br /> Lets jump to Terminator 2 Judgment Day: She has been trained her whole new life. she spend 11 YEARS of her life to learn how to master any combat scenario and weapons, never to become a victim again. She is now considered a Terrorist since she now Knows the truth.<br /> <br /> Same scenario with Ripley, after the event's of Alien. she was forced to be capable of not only being able to survive, but to fight.<br /> <br /> Hunter's KNOW they are on the loosing team, they know they are against all Odds. they dont have the right tools, they are not organized<br /> <br /> i think its normal for them to slowly become more and more militarized<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T13:12:30-07:00","id":849419,"title":"","content":"Glad to get an answer there thankfully<br /> <br /> I think that with a generation growing up with the imbued around the imbued will start trying to retrieve most recent imbued post haste setting up a Sub chapter of Hunter.net devoted to just that, while scholars of the supernatural, Pentex, the Arcanum,Mages of all stripes and probaly some others cant even think of will research their origins, and be desperate to find just WHO the Heralds are and why their doing this.<br /> <br /> Pentex in particular would find hunters a threat to the Omega plan.<br /> <br /> another odd example<br /> <br /> DNA is easily seen as a Traditional protaganist, as its trying to cure, what they see as an abhornent illness, and want to reverse engineer the beneficial aspects of it to benefit all of humanity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 03-18-2016, 08:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T21:06:08-07:00","id":849600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/849090-world-of-darkness-and-inverting-traditional-perceptions-on-protaganists?p=849419#post849419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DNA is easily seen as a Traditional protaganist, as its trying to cure, what they see as an abhornent illness, and want to reverse engineer the beneficial aspects of it to benefit all of humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Hair-Dog-Brett-Davis/dp/0671877623\" target=\"_blank\">Hair of the Dog by Brett Davis</a> is a great inspiration for DNA. Since it involves a &quot;Cure Disability&quot; charity organization that while has good intentions in helping families that have people in their care that have lycanthropy, the &quot;cure&quot; ends up making people 'lobotomized'. Thus the &quot;Cure&quot; is actually way worse than being afflicted.<br /> <br /> So it wouldn't be hard to compare DNA to something akin to &quot;Autism Speaks&quot; or Dr. Andrew Wakefield in the real world.<br /> Which both have done a lot of damage instead of the beneficial 'good' they claimed they would do.<br /> In the case of Dr. Wakefield, DNA could be easily corrupted into the, &quot;Means justify the ends no matter what.&quot;.<br /> With inspiration from &quot;AS&quot;, you can have DNA claiming what a huge epidemic &quot;GLS&quot; is and featuring sad looking children (kinfolk) in their brochures.<br /> Also, well... <a href=\"http://www.autistichoya.com/2013/11/an-unholy-alliance-autism-speaks-and.html\" target=\"_blank\">read this</a>.<br /> <br /> A lot of the rhetoric is no different for what was being said about the &quot;Deaf Community&quot; a couple of decades ago. Or if you go far back enough, the rhetoric that was used on those that used their &quot;left&quot; hand. Or look at religious organizations that try to &quot;cure&quot; people who aren't straight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T14:08:00-07:00","id":851348,"title":"","content":"Heard of such things sadly... Heard of some people wanting to outlaw conversian therapy, even if the person WANTS to go through it.<br /> <br /> Hmmmn but think im right on Disappearing a Garou cub or childling... we usualy only think of the parents involved, in their role as a foil for the protaganist.<br /> <br /> in spite of the fact their role as pursuers would fit comfortably as protaganists on many TV shows or movies.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}